# Everything is already stored LF. Pin the working tree to LF as well, so a
# Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true does not end up CRLF on disk -- which
# makes oxfmt flag every file in the repo and `pnpm format` rewrite all of them.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never transform these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
